{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tum Tum Tum: Dance Party \u2014 Timing? Never Heard of Her</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/d32ecf3c99f3f72ecd150452f4f2e4f8.avif?t=1759918115\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hey, welcome to Tum Tum Tum: Dance Party \u2013 basically a dumb little rhythm game I threw together because memes are life and who has time for epic quests anyway? It's short, stupid, and full of Italian brainrot vibes. You press arrows to beats while controlling idiots like Tung Tung Tung Sahur, Brrbrr Patapim, Tralalelotralala, Bombardillo Crocodillo, or Chimpanzini Bananini. Play alone, or drag a friend into a local duel and laugh at how bad you both are. No deep meaning here, just vibes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/70edc47173c3a3ed1f6d77731b268ded.poster.avif?t=1759918115\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/70edc47173c3a3ed1f6d77731b268ded.webm?t=1759918115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/70edc47173c3a3ed1f6d77731b268ded.mp4?t=1759918115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythmic Precision</strong>: Arrows fly at you, hit 'em on time or your dance looks like a drunk uncle at a wedding. Get it right, and chain some combos for points \u2013 big whoop. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombardillo Time Combo System</strong>: Nail 10 in a row, and boom, bonus mode with particles and breakdance flips. It's flashy, but don't pretend it's revolutionary. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Local Multiplayer</strong>: Split-screen battle on one PC with controllers or keyboard. Trash-talk your buddy while you both flail. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Challenge</strong>: Fight an AI that's probably smarter than me. It gets harder, good for wasting a few minutes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Mode Vibes</strong>: Hang out in a fake club with oriental backdrops and graffiti walls. Practice moves, mess around, no pressure \u2013 like the game itself. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual and Audio Spectacle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/4b1771b65e07ca1bed1317759b649c35.avif?t=1759918115\" width=1600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cartoon stages covered in colorful crap, animations that pop when you don't suck, and tunes mixed with meme garbage to keep it mildly addictive. Particles explode, breakdances happen \u2013 it's cute, but let's not act like it's art. Perfect for a quick laugh before you get bored and play something else. Brainrot incoming, enjoy the nothing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736190?t=1759918115","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736190?t=1759918115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/1a33b0177c1d5a5aed7a0a0ac73c4e79ff463dc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759918115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/1a33b0177c1d5a5aed7a0a0ac73c4e79ff463dc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759918115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/d310d7404537e8ea917c6efd6ec2d08b.avif?t=1759918115\" width=1500 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LAUNCH WEEK \u2014 25% OFF AT RELEASE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to Wishlist to get notified. Chain PERFECTs, trigger Bombardillo Time, and battle in Solo or local 1v1 across 5 arenas.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tum Tum Tum: Dance Party \u2014 Timing? Never Heard of Her</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/d32ecf3c99f3f72ecd150452f4f2e4f8.avif?t=1759918115\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hey, welcome to Tum Tum Tum: Dance Party \u2013 basically a dumb little rhythm game I threw together because memes are life and who has time for epic quests anyway? It's short, stupid, and full of Italian brainrot vibes. You press arrows to beats while controlling idiots like Tung Tung Tung Sahur, Brrbrr Patapim, Tralalelotralala, Bombardillo Crocodillo, or Chimpanzini Bananini. Play alone, or drag a friend into a local duel and laugh at how bad you both are. No deep meaning here, just vibes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/70edc47173c3a3ed1f6d77731b268ded.poster.avif?t=1759918115\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/70edc47173c3a3ed1f6d77731b268ded.webm?t=1759918115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/70edc47173c3a3ed1f6d77731b268ded.mp4?t=1759918115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythmic Precision</strong>: Arrows fly at you, hit 'em on time or your dance looks like a drunk uncle at a wedding. Get it right, and chain some combos for points \u2013 big whoop. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bombardillo Time Combo System</strong>: Nail 10 in a row, and boom, bonus mode with particles and breakdance flips. It's flashy, but don't pretend it's revolutionary. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Local Multiplayer</strong>: Split-screen battle on one PC with controllers or keyboard. Trash-talk your buddy while you both flail. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Challenge</strong>: Fight an AI that's probably smarter than me. It gets harder, good for wasting a few minutes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Mode Vibes</strong>: Hang out in a fake club with oriental backdrops and graffiti walls. Practice moves, mess around, no pressure \u2013 like the game itself. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual and Audio Spectacle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/extras/4b1771b65e07ca1bed1317759b649c35.avif?t=1759918115\" width=1600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cartoon stages covered in colorful crap, animations that pop when you don't suck, and tunes mixed with meme garbage to keep it mildly addictive. Particles explode, breakdances happen \u2013 it's cute, but let's not act like it's art. Perfect for a quick laugh before you get bored and play something else. Brainrot incoming, enjoy the nothing.</p>","developers":["DrSillystein"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736190/3ae78aac94599222158e3608ea4adaa356cc1f7c/header.jpg?t=1759918115","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736190/1680310112/a3f51d9ba4993dabdc4c857e4f2ea9758b6c238e/1755071681/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755185435","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736190/1680310112/a3f51d9ba4993dabdc4c857e4f2ea9758b6c238e/1755071681/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755185435","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736190/1680310112/a3f51d9ba4993dabdc4c857e4f2ea9758b6c238e/1755071681/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755185435","id":257182493,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257182493/movie480.mp4?t=1755185435","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257182493/movie_max.mp4?t=1755185435"},"name":"TumTumTum","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182493/e06057e64539258d3381475022e4f09f56951c55/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755185435","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257182493/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755185435","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257182493/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755185435"}}],"name":"TUM TUM TUM: Dance Party","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD 630 / GeF